{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_30_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_30","textTraditional":"一、元年，春，王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_30_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_30","textTraditional":"繼弒君不言即位，正也。繼弒君不言即位之為正，何也？曰先君不以其道終，則子不忍即位也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_30_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_30","textTraditional":"二、三月，夫人孫於齊。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_30_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_30","textTraditional":"孫之為言猶遜也，諱奔也。接練時，錄母之變，始人之也。不言氏姓，貶之也。人之於天也，以道受命；於人也，以言受命。不若於道者，天絕之也；不若於言者，人絕之也。臣子大受命。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_30_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_30","textTraditional":"三、夏，單伯逆王姬。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_30_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_30","textTraditional":"單伯者何？吾大夫之命乎天子者也。命大夫，故不名也。其不言如何也？其義不可受於京師也。其義不可受於京師何也？曰躬君弒於齊，使之主婚，與齊為禮，其義固不可受也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_30_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_30","textTraditional":"四、秋，築王姬之館於外。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_30_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_30","textTraditional":"築，禮也。於外，非禮也。築之為禮何也？主王姬者，必自公門出。於廟則已尊，於寢則已卑。為之築，節矣。築之外，變之正也。築之外變之為正何也？仇仇之人，非所以接婚姻也。衰麻非所以接弁冕也。其不言齊侯之來逆何也？不使齊侯得與吾為禮也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_30_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_30","textTraditional":"五、冬，十月，乙亥，陳侯林卒。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_30_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_30","textTraditional":"諸侯日卒，正也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_30_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_30","textTraditional":"六、王使榮叔來錫桓公命。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_30_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_30","textTraditional":"禮有受命，無來錫命。錫命，非正也。生服之，死行之，禮也。生不服，死追錫之，不正甚矣。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_30_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_30","textTraditional":"七、王姬歸於齊。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_30_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_30","textTraditional":"為之中者歸之也。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_30_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_30","textTraditional":"八、齊師遷紀、郱、鄑、郚。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_30_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_30","textTraditional":"郱、鄑、郚，國也。或曰：遷紀於郱、鄑、郚。","sentenceOrder":16}],"overrides":{}}